 Canadian and international tax challenges are part of our everyday work;
 Strong interpersonal and analytical skills are at the heart of our team;
 Learning opportunities are endless;
 Personal and professional development is encouraged;
 Teamwork and collaboration are key drivers of success;
 Innovation in the way we work is strongly encouraged;
 Work-life balance and flexible work arrangements are supported;
 Continuous improvement, automation and the responsible use of artificial intelligence allow us to focus our work on analysis and solving complex tax issues.
